# Browser
# As a player casts an omen card they choose to cast it normally or as its Omen (CR 720.3), so Bot1's page offers both in
# Twinmaw Stormbrood's menu when both can be paid for: "Cast Twinmaw Stormbrood" ({5}{W}, printed on the card) and "Cast
# Charring Bite {1}{R}..." - the Omen named as the spell it casts, with the Omen's own cost, which the creature card in the
# hand does not show, and a target to choose. Bot1 casts Charring Bite at Bot2's Llanowar Elves; the stack shows Charring
# Bite (CR 720.3b), and as it resolves the card is shuffled into Bot1's library (CR 720.3d): eight cards, none in the
# graveyard.

